(125, 'CausticArrow&MirageArcher', 'When Caustic Arrow hits an enemy, an apparition is created above you that fires a copy of Caustic Arrow at enemies, at a reduced rate and with less damage.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/CausticArrow/CausticArrow+MirageArcher.bk2', 353, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/CausticArrow/CausticArrow+MirageArcher.bk2', '[2,4,5,3]'),
(126, 'CausticArrow&ViciousProjectiles', 'Greatly increases both the physical damage from hits and chaos damage over time component of Caustic Arrow.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/CausticArrow/CausticArrow+ViciousProjectiles.bk2', 232, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/CausticArrow/CausticArrow+ViciousProjectiles.bk2', '[]'),
(127, 'CausticArrow&WitheringTouch', 'Grants extra chaos damage based on your physical damage. It also has a chance to inflict the Withered debuff which causes enemies to take 6% increased chaos damage per Wither stack (up to 15). ', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/CausticArrow/CausticArrow+WitheringTouch.bk2', 372, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/CausticArrow/CausticArrow+WitheringTouch.bk2', '[]'),
(128, 'CausticArrow&Poison', 'Gives a high chance for Caustic Arrow to inflict the poison ailment on hit. Poison deals chaos damage over time so it benefits from a lot of the same stats that Caustic Arrow''s caustic ground does. ', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/CausticArrow/CausticArrow+Poison.bk2', 303, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/CausticArrow/CausticArrow+Poison.bk2', '[2,4,5,3]'),
(129, 'Smite&AncestralCall', 'Allows Smite to target two additional nearby enemies. As Smite is an area of effect attack, this support can result in areas where damage overlaps, greatly increasing damage.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Smite/Smite+AncestralCall.bk2', 351, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/Smite/Smite+AncestralCall.bk2', '[6,2,4,0,3]'),
(130, 'Smite&MeleePhysicalDamage', 'Grants more melee physical damage for Smite. Because 50% of physical damage is converted to lightning damage, this support will also increase the lightning damage done by Smite.  ', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Smite/Smite+MeleePhysicalDamage.bk2', 83, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/Smite/Smite+MeleePhysicalDamage.bk2', '[]'),
(131, 'Smite&PhysicalToLightning', 'Converts 50% of Smite''s physical damage to lightning damage, as well as providing extra lightning damage based on your physical damage. Because 50% of physical damage is already converted to lightning from the skill gem this causes all physical damage with Smite to deal lightning damage instead. ', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Smite/Smite+PhysicaltoLightning.bk2', 267, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/Smite/Smite+PhysicaltoLightning.bk2', '[]'),
(132, 'Smite&ElementalDamageWithAttacks', 'Multiplies the elemental damage done by Smite. Converting all physical damage from Smite to elemental damage maximizes the benefit this support provides.  ', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Smite/Smite+ElementalDamagewithAttacks.bk2', 113, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/Smite/Smite+WeaponElementalDamage.bk2', '[]'),
(133, 'Smite&Multistrike', 'Causes Smite to repeat an additional two times, as well as providing a large bonus to attack speed.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Smite/Smite+Multistrike.bk2', 189, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/Smite/Smite+Multistrike.bk2', '[]'),
(134, 'Smite&ElementalFocus', 'Removes the ability for Smite to inflict elemental ailments, such as shock, on enemies. However, it significantly boosts the amount of elemental damage Smite does. Converting all physical damage from Smite to elemental damage maximizes the benefit this support provides.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Smite/Smite+ElementalFocus.bk2', 319, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/Smite/Smite+ElementalFocus.bk2', '[]'),
(135, 'Frostbolt&AddedColdDamage', 'Increases the amount of flat cold damage your Frostbolt does.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Frostbolt/Frostbolt+AddedColdDamage.bk2', 37, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/Frostbolt/Frostbolt%20+%20Added%20Cold%20Damage.bk2', '[2,1,5,3]'),
(136, 'Frostbolt&ColdPenetration', 'Reduces enemy resistance to cold damage, making them take more cold damage from Frostbolt.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Frostbolt/Frostbolt+ColdPenetration.bk2', 175, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/Frostbolt/Frostbolt%20+%20Cold%20Penetration.bk2', '[]'),
(137, 'Frostbolt&Hypothermia', 'Provides an increase to chill and freeze chance with Frostbolt, as well as providing more damage against chilled enemies. ', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Frostbolt/Frostbolt+Hypothermia.bk2', 284, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/Frostbolt/Frostbolt%20+%20Hypothermia.bk2', '[]'),
(138, 'Frostbolt&ControlledDestruction', 'Grants more spell damage to Frostbolt but reduces critical strike chance. The more spell damage provided by this support allows a direct and stable increase in damage not contingent on critical strikes.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Frostbolt/Frostbolt+ControlledDestruction.bk2', 310, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/Frostbolt/Frostbolt%20+%20Controlled%20Destruction.bk2', '[]'),
(139, 'Frostbolt&SpellEcho', 'Repeats Frostbolt an additional time while also greatly increasing the cast speed.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Frostbolt/Frostbolt+SpellEcho.bk2', 190, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/Frostbolt/Frostbolt%20+%20Spell%20Echo.bk2', '[]'),
(140, 'Frostbolt&SpellTotem', 'Allows you to summon a totem that uses Frostbolt, freeing up your character to perform other actions. Can become exceeding powerful once your character gains abilities to summon multiple totems. ', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Frostbolt/Frostbolt+SpellTotem.bk2', 150, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/Frostbolt/Frostbolt%20+%20Spell%20Totem.bk2', '[6,2,0,1]'),
(141, 'Blight&IncreasedDuration', 'Increases the duration of Blight''s slow effect and chaos damage over time debuff on enemies.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Blight/Blight+IncreasedDuration.bk2', 108, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/Blight/Blight+IncreasedDuration.bk2', '[]'),
(142, 'CausticArrow&SwiftAffliction', 'Decreases the duration of Caustic Arrow''s ground effect, but compensates for this by increasing damage over time dealt.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/CausticArrow/CausticArrow+SwiftAffliction.bk2', 311, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/CausticArrow/CausticArrow+SwiftAffliction.bk2', '[]'),
(143, 'CausticArrow&VoidManipulation', 'Grants more chaos damage but lowers the elemental damage of Caustic Arrow. The Caustic ground effect only deals chaos damage, so Void Manipulation gives more damage at no drawback.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/CausticArrow/CausticArrow+VoidManipulation.bk2', 309, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/CausticArrow/CausticArrow+VoidManipulation.bk2', '[]'),
(144, 'FreezingPulse&AddedColdDamage', 'Increases the amount of flat cold damage your Freezing Pulse does.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/FreezingPulse/FreezingPulse+AddedColdDamage.bk2', 37, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/FreezingPulse/FreezingPulse+AddedColdDamage.bk2', '[2,1,5,3]'),
(145, 'FrostBlades&IceBite', 'Adds additional cold damage to Frost Blades, increasing freeze chance, and granting a chance to gain a Frenzy Charge on killing a frozen enemy.

Frenzy Charges increase a player''s attack speed, cast speed and damage.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/FrostBlades/Frostblades+IceBite.bk2', 283, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/FrostBlades/Frostblades+Icebite.bk2', '[]'),
(146, 'Frostbolt&FasterCasts', 'Increases the cast speed of Frost Bolt, allowing the projectiles to be cast more frequently.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Frostbolt/Frostbolt+FasterCasts.bk2', 86, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/Frostbolt/Frostbolt+FasterCasts.bk2', '[]'),
(147, 'GlacialHammer&Hypothermia', 'Increases Glacial Hammer''s damage and freeze chance against enemies that are chilled. Also increases the slow effect of chills applied by your Glacial Hammer.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/GlacialHammer/GlacialHammer+Hypothermia.bk2', 284, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/GlacialHammer/GlacialHammer+Hypothermia.bk2', '[]'),
(148, 'MagmaOrb&FasterCast', 'Increases the cast speed of Rolling Magma, allowing the projectiles to be cast more frequently.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/MagmaOrb/MagmaOrb+FasterCast.bk2', 86, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/MagmaOrb/MagmaOrb+FasterCasting.bk2', '[]'),
(149, 'RaiseZombie&MeleePhysicalDamage', 'Grants more melee physical damage for your Zombie minions attacks. This support also increases the amount of damage inflicted bleeds and poisons do.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/RaiseZombies/RaiseZombies+PhysicalMeleeDamage.bk2', 83, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/RaiseZombies/RaiseZombies+PhysicalMeleeDamage.bk2', '[]'),
(150, 'SpectralThrow&AddedFireDamage', 'Grants extra fire damage to your Spectral Throws''s hits based on the physical damage dealt.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/SpectralThrow/SpectralThrow+AddedFireDamage.bk2', 32, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/SpectralThrow/SpectralThrow+AddedFireDamage.bk2', '[6,2,4,0,5,3]'),
(151, 'SplitArrow&FasterAttacks', 'Increases the attack speed of Split Arrow, allowing players to fire arrows more frequently', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/SplitArrow/SplitArrow+FasterAttacks.bk2', 33, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/SplitArrow/SplitArrow+ChancetoBleed.bk2', '[]'),
(152, 'SplitArrow&ChanceToBleed', 'Increases the chance of inflicting the bleed ailment on enemies with Split Arrow. Bleeding deals physical damage over time, with more damage dealt to moving targets. This support also adds a small amount of flat physical damage to Split Arrow.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/SplitArrow/SplitArrow+ChancetoBleed.bk2', 329, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/SplitArrow/SplitArrow+FasterAttacks.bk2', '[4,6,2,0,3]'),
(153, 'PurifyingFlame&AddedFire', 'Grants additional fire damage based on your physical damage. ', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/PurifyingFlame/PF+AddedFire.bk2', 32, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/PurifyingFlames/PurifyingFlames+AddedFireDamageCN.bk2', '[4,6,2,0]'),
(154, 'PurifyingFlame&PhysToLightning', 'Converts 50% of Purifying Flame''s physical damage to lightning damage, as well as providing extra lightning damage based on your physical damage. Because 50% of physical damage is already converted to fire from the skill gem, this causes all physical damage with Purifying Flame to deal elemental damage.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/PurifyingFlame/PF+PhystoLightning.bk2', 267, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/PurifyingFlames/PurifyingFlames+PhysicaltoLightningCN.bk2', '[]'),
(155, 'PurifyingFlame&Intensify', 'Increases Purifying Flame''s area of effect and grants Intensify stacks with each cast, reducing its area of effect and increasing its damage. This helps it damage tough enemies with repeated casts. 

When you move or teleport you gradually lose Intensity stacks.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/PurifyingFlame/PF+Int.bk2', 393, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/PurifyingFlames/PurifyingFlames+IntensifyCN.bk2', '[]'),
(156, 'PurifyingFlame&ControlledDestruction', 'Grants more spell damage to Purifying Flame but reduces critical strike chance. The more spell damage provided by this support allows a direct and stable increase in damage not contingent on critical strikes.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/PurifyingFlame/PF+ControlledDestruction.bk2', 310, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/PurifyingFlames/PurifyingFlames+ControlledDestructionCN.bk2', '[]'),
(157, 'PurifyingFlame&Unleash', 'Slowly grants charges of Purifying Flame over time. These expend when cast to unleash repeat effects of the skill, rapidly damaging enemies multiple times. The damage of the unleashed casts are slightly reduced.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/PurifyingFlame/PF+Unleash.bk2', 394, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/PurifyingFlames/PurifyingFlames+UnleashCN.bk2', '[]'),
(158, 'PurifyingFlame&ElementalFocus', 'Removes the ability for Purifying Flame to inflict elemental ailments, such as ignite, on enemies. However, it significantly increases the amount of elemental damage Purifying Flame does. Converting all physical damage from Purifying Flame to elemental damage maximizes the benefit this support provides.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/PurifyingFlame/PF+EF.bk2', 319, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/PurifyingFlames/PurifyingFlames+ElementalFocusCN.bk2', '[]'),
(159, 'StormblastMine&AddedLightning', 'Adds flat lightning damage to Stormblast Mine''s explosions.

Dealing more damage also increases the strength of Shock, causing more damage taken on Shocked enemies.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/StormblastMine/EStormblastAddedLight.bk2', 40, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TStormblastAddedLight.bk2', '[5,1,6,2]'),
(160, 'StormblastMine&SwiftAssembly', 'While Swift Assembly supports Stormblast Mine, throwing a Mine grants a chance to throw additional mines. More mines means more Stormblast Explosions', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/StormblastMine/EStormblastSwiftAssembly.bk2', 432, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TStormblastSwiftAssembly.bk2', '[5,1,3,4,2]'),
(161, 'StormblastMine&Trap&MineDamage', 'Causes Stormblast mine explosions to deal more damage.

Dealing more damage also increases the strength of Shock, causing more damage taken on Shocked enemies.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/StormblastMine/EStormblastTrapMine.bk2', 287, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TStormblastTrapMine.bk2', '[]'),
(162, 'StormblastMine&LightningPenetration', 'Allows Stormblast mine''s lightning damage to penetrate lightning resistance. This allows for more consistent damage against lightning-resistant enemies, such as Bosses, Rares, and Magic enemies.

Monsters show if they are resistant to damage in their mods. Hover over monsters to see their mods.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/StormblastMine/EStormblastLightPen.bk2', 176, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TStormblastLightningPen.bk2', '[]'),
(163, 'StormblastMine&ChargedMines', 'While Charged Mines is linked, damaging enemies with Stormblast explosions has a chance to grant you Frenzy and Power Charges.

Frenzy charges increase the speed that you move, attack and cast spells for each charge (up to a maximum of 3).

Power charges increases your chance to critically strike for high damage each charge (up to a maximum of 3).', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/StormblastMine/EStormblastCharged.bk2', 365, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TStormblastChargedMines.bk2', '[]'),
(164, 'StormblastMine&IncreasedAoE', 'Increased Area of Effect makes your Stormblast Mine explosions wider, so they can hit more enemies. It also means Stormblast Mine can cause more enemies to take increased damage before exploding.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/StormblastMine/EStormblastIncreasedAoE.bk2', 39, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TStormblastIncreasedAoE.bk2', '[]'),
(165, 'StormblastMine&ConcentratedEffect', 'Concentrated Effect makes your Stormblast explosions smaller, causing more damage in a tighter area.
This means they can hit less enemies but they deal more damage to the enemies they hit.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/StormblastMine/EStormblastConcAoE.bk2', 106, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TStormblastConcentratedAoE.bk2', '[]'),
(166, 'CobraLash&LMP', 'Increase the number of Cobra Lash projectiles thrown, hitting multiple targets over a wider area. Each projectile will bounce between targets to hit large groups of enemies.

Obtain the Greater Multiple Projectiles Support gem at later levels to throw more projectiles and hit larger groups of enemies.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/CobraLash/ECobraLashLMP.bk2', 35, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TCobraLashLMP.bk2', '[5,1,3,4,2]'),
(167, 'CobraLash&Poison', 'Increase Cobra Lash''s chance to poison enemies and cause it to deal more poison damage. This is valuable for applying multiple deadly poisons on enemies.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/CobraLash/ECobraLashPoison.bk2', 303, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TCobraLashPoison.bk2', '[]'),
(168, 'CobraLash&DeadlyAilments', 'Cause Cobra Lash to deal a great amount more poison damage, at the cost of slightly reduced hit damage.
This is valuable for applying strong poisons on enemies.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/CobraLash/ECobraLashDeadlyAilments.bk2', 331, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TCobraLashDeadlyAilments.bk2', '[]'),
(169, 'CobraLash&AddedChaos', 'Add flat chaos damage to Cobra Lash, increasing the damage it deals when it hits enemies.

Increasing chaos damage of your hits also increases the damage of your poison, as strong hits with lots of chaos and physical damage also means stronger poisons.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/CobraLash/ECobraLashAddedC.bk2', 60, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TCobraLashAddedC.bk2', '[]'),
(170, 'CobraLash&VileToxins', 'Vile Toxins increases the damage of Cobra Lash poison, and causes more damage when Cobra Lash hits poisoned enemies.This is valuable for stacking strong poisons and dealing more damage against powerful enemies, like bosses.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/CobraLash/ECobraLashVile.bk2', 335, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TCobraLashVile.bk2', '[]'),
(171, 'CobraLash&UnboundAilments', 'Unbound Ailments causes Cobra Lash poison to deal more damage and to last longer on enemies. This is valuable for stacking lots of poison on strong enemies, like bosses.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/CobraLash/ECobraLashUnboundAilments.bk2', 338, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TCobraLashUnboundAilments.bk2', '[5,1,6,2]'),
(172, 'Perforate&Maim', 'Support Perforate with this gem to Maim enemies, dealing more physical damage and slowing their movement. Use this to slow monsters and make them easier to avoid.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Perforate/EPerforateMaim.bk2', 336, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TPerforateMaim.bk2', '[4,3,0,2]'),
(173, 'Perforate&MeleePhysicalDamage', 'This gem causes Perforate to deal more damage. A simple but invaluable way to quickly kill enemies.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Perforate/EPerforateMeleePhysical.bk2', 83, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TPerforateMeleePhysical.bk2', '[]'),
(174, 'Perforate&CloseCombat', 'Close Combat improves your damage against monsters close to you. As Perforate only hits nearby enemies (without Sand stance), this support is a valuable way to increase your damage.

Travel Skills are also quicker after you hit enemies with this gem. Travel skills move you quickly to avoid danger.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Perforate/EPerforateClosecombat.bk2', 406, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TPerforateCloseCombat.bk2', '[]'),
(175, 'Perforate&Impale', 'Deal more physical damage and Impale enemies with the Impale debuff.

Impaling enemies stores some of your damage on the enemy. For the next 5 hits on that enemy you deal extra stored damage. You can impale the same enemy more than once for extra damage from attacks.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Perforate/EPerforateImpale.bk2', 411, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TPerforateImpale.bk2', '[]'),
(176, 'Perforate&Brutality', 'Cause Perforate to deal much more physical damage, but reduce any elemental damage it deals to zero.

Try not to get any modifiers that grant lightning, fire, cold or chaos damage with this support gem. Only physical damage will be increased by this gem.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Perforate/EPerforateBrutality.bk2', 339, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TPerforateBrutality.bk2', '[]'),
(177, 'Perforate&Multistrike', 'Greatly increase Perforate''s attacking speed by performing three attacks in quick succession, dealing more damage on the second and third attacks.

You cannot stop or move while multistriking. This gem greatly improves damage but be careful not to get stuck while monsters damage you.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Perforate/EPerforateMultiStrike.bk2', 189, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TPerforateMultiStrike.bk2', '[]'),
(178, 'Frostblink&IncreasedAoE', 'Increase the size of Frostblink''s cold explosion and chilled ground. This is valuable for damaging multiple enemies and leaving them slowed, unable to pursue you.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Frostblink/EFrostblinkIncreasedAoE.bk2', 39, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TFrostblinkIncreasedAoE.bk2', '[]'),
(179, 'Frostblink&BoneChill', 'Bonechill makes Frostblink''s chill effect more potent, slowing enemies further to keep you safe. Enemies chilled by Frostblink also take more Cold Damage, making this valuable for your main skill if it deals cold damage.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Frostblink/EFrostblinkBonechill.bk2', 373, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TFrostblinkBonechill.bk2', '[]'),
(180, 'Steelskin&IncreasedDuration', 'Allow Steelskin''s bonus to last longer, to defend against more hits from enemies. A simple but valuable way to improve defense.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Steelskin/ESteelskinDuration.bk2', 108, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TSteelskinDuration.bk2', '[]'),
(181, 'Steelskin&CWDT', 'Automatically cast Steelskin after taking damage. This is valuable for defending against surprise attacks.

Steelskin can not be cast manually with this gem, and cannot be used to defend against a monster about to hit you. It''s important to have another way to defend against monsters if you use this gem.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/Steelskin/ESteelskinCWDT.bk2', 214, 'https://down.qq.com/poe/videos/skills/TSteelskinCWDT.bk2', '[]'),
(182, 'GalvanicArrow&PhystoLightning', 'This gem makes all of Galvanic Arrows physical damage turn to lightning damage. This causes Galvanic Arrow deal full lightning damage, instead of 50% lightning and 50% physical damage.

This gem makes it much easier to increase your damage. If you get any skills that increase your lighting or elemental damage, it will increase the full lightning damage dealt by Galvanic Arrow.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/GalvanicArrow/EGalvanicArrowPhysToLightning.bk2', 267, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/TGalvanicArrowDamage1.bk2', '[]'),
(183, 'GalvanicArrow&ElementalDamagewithAttacks', 'Increase Galvanic Arrow''s elemental damage, hitting enemies harder for more damage.
This gem will not increase the physical damage dealt by Galvanic Arrow, but it will increase the lightning damage it deals. 

This gem is very good when paired with the Physical to Lightning support gem, as it will increase the full lightning damage dealt by Galvanic Arrow.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/GalvanicArrow/EGalvanicArrowElementalDamageWithAttacks.bk2', 113, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/TGalvanicArrowDamage2.bk2', '[]'),
(184, 'GalvanicArrow&LightningPenetration', 'Allow Galvanic Arrow''s lightning damage to penetrate lightning resistance on enemies. This allows for more consistent damage against lightning-resistant enemies, such as Bosses, Rares, and Magic enemies.

This will not allow Galvanic Arrow''s physical damage to penetrate resistance, as physical damage is unaffected by lightning resistance.
Monsters show if they are resistant to damage in their mods. Hover over monsters to see their mods.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/GalvanicArrow/EGalvanicArrowLightPen.bk2', 176, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/TGalvanicArrowLightPen.bk2', '[]'),
(185, 'GalvanicArrow&MirageArcher', 'Summon a Mirage Archer above your head when Galvanic Arrow hits an enemy. This Mirage Archer will fire Galvanic Arrows at nearby enemies until it disappears.

This gem has many uses. Use it to attack enemies while you''re moving, to attack enemies you''re not facing, or to deal more damage.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/GalvanicArrow/EGalvanicArrowMirage.bk2', 353, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/TGalvanicArrowMirage.bk2', '[]'),
(186, 'GalvanicArrow&Barrage', 'Let loose a flurry of arrows with the Barrage support gem. With each Galvanic Arrow fired, lightning will burst from your bow.This will stop your arrows from firing in a cone, and instead make them fire in sequence.

This gem is invaluable for unleashing a flurry of attacks on strong enemies, like bosses.
Be careful using it in dangerous dangerous situations. You cannot move while firing, so you cannot escape dangerous enemies.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/GalvanicArrow/EGalvanicArrowBarrage.bk2', 435, '', '[]'),
(187, 'GalvanicArrow&FasterProjectiles', 'Increase the size of Galvanic Arrow''s lightning burst, and the speed of its arrows before they dissipate. This gem is invaluable for making your lightning burst bigger and your arrows fire further, hitting more enemies with each shot.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/GalvanicArrow/EGalvanicArrowFasterProj.bk2', 36, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/TGalvanicArrowFasterProj.bk2', '[]'),
(188, 'KineticBolt&Barrage', 'Fire a flurry of Kinetic Bolts in quick succession, damaging enemies consistently over a wide area. 

You cannot stop or move while firing. This gem improves damage but be careful not to get stuck taking damage while monsters attack you.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/EKineticBolt/EKineticBoltBarrage.bk2', 435, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/TKineticBoltBarrage.bk2', '[]'),
(189, 'KineticBolt&AddedLightningDamage', 'Add lightning damage to Kinetic Bolt and its projectiles. A simple but valuable way to quickly kill enemies.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/EKineticBolt/EKineticBoltLightning.bk2', 40, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/TKineticBoltLightning.bk2', '[1]'),
(190, 'KineticBolt&AddedColdDamage', 'Add cold damage to Kinetic Bolt and its projectiles. A simple but valuable way to quickly kill enemies.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/EKineticBolt/EKineticBoltCold.bk2', 37, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/TKineticBoltCold.bk2', '[]'),
(191, 'KineticBolt&ElementalDamageWithAttacks', 'Increase the elemental damage dealt by Kinetic Bolt and its projectiles.

Kinetic Bolt doesn''t inherently deal elemental damage. Added elemental damage can come from equipment (or from Added Lightning and Added Cold support gems). This gem can increase that damage to more quickly kill enemies.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/EKineticBolt/EKineticBoltDamage.bk2', 113, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/TKineticBoltDamage.bk2', '[]'),
(192, 'KineticBolt&Inspiration', 'Reduce the mana cost of using Kinetic Bolt. Also increase Kinetic Bolt''s elemental damage and chance to critically strike with each attack.
Wands can have powerful critical strikes. Critical strikes can deal more damage and inflict elemental ailments on enemies.
Kinetic Bolt doesn''t inherently deal elemental damage. Added elemental damage can come from equipment (or from Added Lightning and Added Cold support gems).', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/EKineticBolt/EKineticBoltInspiration.bk2', 54, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/TKineticBoltInspiration.bk2', '[]'),
(193, 'SplittingSteel&Impale', 'Deal more physical damage and Impale enemies, dealing additional damage to enemies with additional hits. You can impale enemies up to five times to deal even more additional damage to enemies.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/ShatteringSteel/ESplitImpale.bk2', 411, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/TSplitBrutal.bk2', '[]'),
(194, 'SplittingSteel&Brutality', 'Cause Splitting Steel to deal much more physical damage, but no elemental damage.

Try not to get additional lightning, fire, cold or chaos damage with this support gem, as they will be reduced to zero.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/ShatteringSteel/ESplitBrutality.bk2', 339, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/TSplitImpale.bk2', '[]'),
(195, 'SplittingSteel&LMP', 'Increase the number of shards that explode from Splitting Steel when you launch a Steel Shard, hitting more enemies.

Obtain the Greater Multiple Projectiles Support gem at later levels to throw more projectiles and hit larger groups of enemies.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/ShatteringSteel/ESplitMultiProj.bk2', 35, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/TSplitMultiProj.bk2', '[4]'),
(196, 'SplittingSteel&ViciousProjectiles', 'Greatly increases the physical damage dealt by Splitting Steel, at the cost of slightly reducing your attack speed. An invaluable way to increase your damage.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/ShatteringSteel/ESplitViciousProj.bk2', 232, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/TSplitViciousProj.bk2', '[]'),
(197, 'SplittingSteel&Maim', 'Support Splitting Steel with this gem to Maim enemies, dealing more physical damage and slowing their movement. Slow monsters to make them easier to avoid.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/ShatteringSteel/ESplitMaim.bk2', 336, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/TSplitMaim.bk2', '[4]'),
(198, 'SplittingSteel&SlowerProjectiles', 'Slow down your bolts of Splitting Steel to make them hit harder for more damage. The projectiles that explode from Call of Steel''s shards are also slower, and deal more damage.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/ShatteringSteel/ESplitSlowerProj.bk2', 211, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/TSplitSlowerProj.bk2', '[]'),
(199, 'ShieldCrush&Multistrike', 'Greatly increase Shield Crush''s attack speed by performing three attacks in quick succession.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/ShieldCrush/ShieldCrushMultistrike.bk2', 189, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/ShieldCrushMultistrike.bk2', '[]'),
(200, 'ShieldCrush&Pulverise', 'Slows down the attack speed but increases the area of effect and damage of Shield Crush when supported by this gem.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/ShieldCrush/ShieldCrushPulverize.bk2', 414, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/ShieldCrushPulverize.bk2', '[]'),
(201, 'ShieldCrush&MeleePhysicalDamage', 'Slows down the attack speed of Shield Crush but increases the melee physical damage dealt and increases the damage of bleeds and poisons inflicted by Shield Crush.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/ShieldCrush/ShieldCrushMeleePhysBrutality.bk2', 83, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/ShieldCrushMeleePhysBrutality.bk2', '[]'),
(202, 'ShieldCrush&Fortify', 'Grants you Fortify when hitting enemies with Shield Crush when Shield Crush is supported by this gem. Increases the damage of hits and ailments from Shield Crush.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/ShieldCrush/ShieldCrushFortify.bk2', 281, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/ShieldCrushFortify.bk2', '[]'),
(203, 'ShieldCrush&Brutality', 'Greatly increases the physical damage caused by Shield Crush at the price of Shield Crush being unable to deal chaos or elemental damage when supported by this gem.', 'http://web.poecdn.com/public/videos/ShieldCrush/ShieldCrushMeleePhysBrutality.bk2', 339, 'http://down.qq.com/poe/videos/tutorial/ShieldCrushMeleePhysBrutality.bk2', '[]');
